--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Third-party code

This repository builds on and redistributes modified code from:
  - CPL (Ma et al., COLING 2024)
  - SIRUS (NAACL 2025)
  - SharpSeq (Le et al., 2024)
  - SAM / ASAM optimizer: https://github.com/davda54/sam (MIT License)
  - ESAM, GCSAM, FriendlySAM and LookbehindSAM optimizer variants, adapted
    from their authors' public implementations
  - Multi-task weighting methods in CED/SharpSeq/utils/weight_methods.py
    (Nash-MTL, PCGrad, FairGrad and related), adapted from their authors'
    public implementations
  - Loss functions adapted from sentence-transformers (Apache License 2.0,
    https://www.apache.org/licenses/LICENSE-2.0)
Those portions remain under the terms of their original licenses.

No dataset is distributed with this repository. FewRel, TACRED, MAVEN and
ACE 2005 are subject to their own licenses; TACRED and ACE 2005 are distributed
by the LDC and require an LDC license.
